sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Logistics Coordinator
    participant PR as Product Requisition Service
    participant Notif as Notifications Service
    participant Transport as Transport Management Service
    participant EventBus as Event Bus

    User->>PR: Create Product Requisition
    PR->>PR: Validate & Save
    PR->>EventBus: Publish ProductRequisitionCreated
    PR->>User: Return PR Details

    User->>PR: Submit for Approval
    PR->>PR: Update Status (PENDING)
    PR->>EventBus: Publish ProductRequisitionSubmitted
    EventBus->>Notif: ProductRequisitionSubmitted Event
    Notif->>Notif: Send Notification to Approvers

    Note over User: Approver Reviews PR

    User->>PR: Approve PR
    PR->>PR: Update Status (APPROVED)
    PR->>Transport: Create Transport Request
    Transport->>Transport: Generate TR
    Transport->>EventBus: Publish TransportRequestCreated
    PR->>EventBus: Publish ProductRequisitionApproved
    EventBus->>Notif: ProductRequisitionApproved Event
    Notif->>Notif: Send Approval Notification
    PR->>User: Return Approved PR with TR

    Note over Transport: TR triggers TO creation

